  "title": "Lightly Smoked Thai Rice Noodles Pad Thai",
  "description": "A tangy and tender Thai dish featuring chilled butter and smoke, made in a kadhai, this pad thai is an energizing meal option, friendly to ayurvedic tamasic diets",
